# Test binaries from `go test -c`, which CLAUDE.md's qemu commands produce.
*.test

# Binaries built from the tools in this module, which land in the directory
# `go build` was run from rather than in a build cache.
/gen
/sweep
/mdtable

# Profiles and coverage.
*.out
*.prof

# Fuzzing keeps its corpus in the build cache; only failing inputs land in
# testdata/fuzz, and those are worth committing.
